{
  "name": "Jira Clone - AI Task Creator",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "schemaType": "manual",
        "inputSchema": "{\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"title\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"minLength\": 3,\n      \"maxLength\": 300,\n      \"description\": \"Short clear title of the task\"\n    },\n    \"description\": {\n      \"type\": [\"string\", \"null\"],\n      \"maxLength\": 2000,\n      \"description\": \"Detailed description if available\"\n    },\n    \"status\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\"ToDo\", \"InProgress\", \"Done\"],\n      \"description\": \"Task status, default to ToDo\"\n    },\n    \"priority\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\"Low\", \"Medium\", \"High\", \"Critical\"],\n      \"description\": \"Task priority\"\n    },\n    \"type\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"enum\": [\"Task\", \"Story\", \"Bug\"],\n      \"description\": \"Task type\"\n    },\n    \"projectName\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"Project name\"\n    },\n    \"assigneeName\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\",\n      \"description\": \"assigneeName\"\n    },\"dueDate\": {\n      \"type\": \"Date\",\n      \"description\": \"dueDate\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"title\", \"status\", \"priority\", \"type\", \"projectId\"]\n}\n"
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        80,
        352
      ],
      "id": "94b9cacb-1996-4c52-8766-ea4018950dd9",
      "name": "Structured Output Parser"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "Hello !",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are a Jira task creation assistant and information extraction engine.\n\nYour goal is to extract structured JSON from a user message.\n\nInput message:\n{{ $json.body.message }}\n\nReturn a valid JSON object with EXACTLY these fields:\n{\n  \"title\": string,\n  \"description\": string,\n  \"status\": \"ToDo\",\n  \"type\": \"Bug\" | \"Task\" | \"Story\",\n  \"priority\": \"Low\" | \"Medium\" | \"High\" | \"Critical\",\n  \"assigneeName\": string | null,\n  \"projectName\": string | null,\n  \"dueDate\": string | null\n}\n\nRules:\n\n- title:\n  - Short and clear.\n  - Summarize the main action, e.g., \"Validation Email to compare ETA\".\n\n- description:\n  - Summarize the main task in **1–2 sentences**.\n  - **Do NOT include details about assignee, due date, priority, or sprint.**\n  - Focus only on what the task is about.\n\n- status:\n  - Always \"ToDo\"\n\n- type:\n  - If message contains (\"bug\", \"error\", \"fix\") → \"Bug\"\n  - If message contains (\"story\", \"feature\") → \"Story\"\n  - Otherwise → \"Task\"\n\n- priority:\n  - If message contains (\"critical\", \"urgent\") → \"Critical\"\n  - If message contains (\"high\") → \"High\"\n  - If message contains (\"low\") → \"Low\"\n  - Otherwise → \"Medium\"\n\n- assigneeName:\n  - Extract assignee name if specified (e.g., \"assign it to X\")\n  - Otherwise → null\n\n- projectName:\n  - If message contains the word \"Project\", extract the word(s) immediately before \"Project\"\n  - Remove trailing \"Project\" or extra spaces\n  - Otherwise → \"ETA\"\n\n- dueDate:\n  - If the message contains a clear date (formats like 'YYYY-MM-DD' or 'DD/MM/YYYY'), extract it\n  - Otherwise → null\n\nImportant:\n- Return ONLY valid JSON.\n- Ensure the description is concise and task-focused.\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        -64,
        128
      ],
      "id": "48009303-de72-4f79-beef-9a6525a80fc3",
      "name": "Analyze Task Message"
    },
